# Project architecture

- Follow `AGENTS.md`, `docs/architecture.md`, and `docs/technologies-reference.md`.
- Monorepo layout: `apps/web`, `services/api`, `services/worker`, `packages/shared`, `infra/dev`, `docs`, `scripts`.
- Keep V1 modular but not microservice-heavy.
- Pipeline stages live as retryable job stages in Postgres; Celery executes them.
- AI providers (ASR, translation, rewrite, voice, lip sync) must sit behind interfaces; mocks are OK if they implement the same interface.
- Do not introduce mouth redraw (MuseTalk, Wav2Lip), Kubernetes, or live dubbing in V1. Keep the original picture.
- Voice cloning of each original speaker (OmniVoice) is mandatory. An accent never replaces it with a catalog voice. See `.cursor/rules/voice-cloning.mdc`.
- Update `docs/progress-log.md` after meaningful blocks of work.
